========================================
       YouTube for Mac - Instructions
========================================

HOW TO INSTALL:
1. Drag "MacYT.app" to your Applications folder.

IF YOU GET "APP IS DAMAGED OR CANNOT BE OPENED":
Because this app is independently built without a $99/year Apple Developer Certificate, macOS Gatekeeper blocks it on new devices.

EASY FIX:
Run this command in Terminal after moving to Applications:
xattr -cr "/Applications/MacYT.app"
